if INPUT

config INPUT_BB_TRACKBALL
    bool "BlackBerry trackball breakout (4 direction pins)"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_INPUT_BB_TRACKBALL_ENABLED
    help
      Input driver for the BlackBerry trackball breakout boards that expose
      four hall-effect direction pins (UP / DWN / LFT / RHT), plus an
      optional ball-click button. Each pin pulses while the ball rolls in
      that direction; pulses are counted and reported as relative X/Y.

config INPUT_ANALOG_STICK
    bool "Analog joystick as a pointing device"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_INPUT_ANALOG_STICK_ENABLED
    select ADC
    help
      Input driver for a two-potentiometer analog joystick. Both axes are
      sampled on a timer and the deflection past a deadzone is reported as
      relative motion, so the stick behaves as a velocity control rather
      than an absolute axis.

endif # INPUT
